               <code code="34068-7" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="DOSAGE &amp; ADMINISTRATION SECTION"/>
               <title/>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">DOSAGE AND ADMINISTRATION</content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     The recommended dose for adults and children over 12 years of age is two 400 mg tablets (800 mg) three to four times a day.</paragraph>
